# Serpstat

> Serpstat is an AI search and SEO intelligence platform that helps marketers, agencies, and in-house teams win visibility across both traditional search engines and AI-driven discovery surfaces (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews). It combines keyword research, competitor analysis, rank tracking, backlinks, site audit, keyword clustering, and AI brand monitoring (LLM Brand Monitor) on top of a 1.5B+ domain and 8.5B+ keyword data index. Born inside SEO/PPC agency Netpeak in 2013, independent since 2015 as part of Netpeak Group. Trusted by 1.1M+ users, including teams from Deloitte, Rakuten, Visa, Uber, Shopify, and Samsung.

Important facts:

- AI search intelligence is a first-class part of the platform: LLM Brand Monitor tracks how 100+ AI models describe your brand, and the Serpstat MCP server connects Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, and Cursor directly to live SEO data via OAuth.
- SEO data foundation: 1.5B+ domains, 8.5B+ keywords, 529B+ backlinks, 230 supported Google countries, 30K+ new projects added every month.
- Public REST API and the Serpstat MCP server make the platform programmatically accessible to AI agents and coding assistants.
- Free tier with limited access plus a 7-day free trial of paid features. Plans: Individual ($50/mo), Team ($100/mo), Team x2 ($169/mo), Agency ($410/mo).
- Native integrations and apps; browser extensions for Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Opera.
- Available in English, Ukrainian, Spanish, and Russian.
- Not a writing assistant, not an ad-buying platform, not a CRM. Serpstat is an AI search and SEO data and intelligence platform.

## Core SEO platform

- [Keyword Research](https://serpstat.com/keyword-research/): Find keywords, related terms, suggestions with search volume, keyword difficulty, CPC, and PPC competition across 230 countries.
- [Competitor Analysis](https://serpstat.com/competitor-analysis/): Identify SEO and PPC competitors, their best keywords, popular pages, traffic, and visibility metrics.
- [Rank Tracker](https://serpstat.com/rank-tracker/): Daily desktop and mobile rank tracking across any Google country/state/city, with competitor monitoring.
- [Backlink Analysis](https://serpstat.com/backlinks/): Lost and new backlink monitoring, domain rating, anchor and link-type distribution, common link donors.
- [Site Audit](https://serpstat.com/site-audit/): Full-site technical SEO audit with prioritized issues and detailed fix recommendations.
- [Page Audit](https://serpstat.com/page-audit/): Per-page on-site SEO audit and recommendations.
- [Keyword Clustering](https://serpstat.com/keywords-clustering/): Automatic grouping of large keyword sets by semantic similarity for site structure and PPC.

## AI brand monitoring & AI-native access

- [Serpstat MCP Server](https://serpstat.com/page/serpstat-mcp/): Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, and Cursor to live Serpstat data via Model Context Protocol. 63 SEO tools available; HTTP version (OAuth, zero-install) and local STDIO version. Multilingual queries supported.
- [LLM Brand Monitor (overview)](https://serpstat.com/page/llm-brand-monitor/): Track how 100+ AI models (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity) describe your brand — sentiment, share of voice, actionable recommendations.
- [LLM Brand Monitor (product)](https://llmbrandmonitor.com/): Standalone product with free plan (10 checks/month) and Pro tier from $39/month.
- [AI tools for content](https://serpstat.com/page/content-analysis/): AI/ML tools for writers, content marketers, SEO/PPC specialists — meta tag generation, paraphrasing, transcription, AI content detection.
- [AI Content Detection](https://serpstat.com/page/ai-content-detection/): Standalone checker for AI-generated text.

## Standalone & free tools

- [Free SEO Tools](https://serpstat.com/page/free-seo-tools/): Hub of free Serpstat tools.
- [Website Traffic Checker](https://serpstat.com/page/website-traffic-checker/): Free traffic estimate for any domain.
- [Domain Authority Checker](https://serpstat.com/page/domain-authority-checker/): Single-domain DA/DR check.
- [Bulk Domain Authority Checker](https://serpstat.com/page/bulk-da-checker/): Batch DA checking for many domains.
- [Keyword Difficulty Tool](https://serpstat.com/page/keyword-difficulty-tool/): Difficulty assessment for SEO target keywords.
- [Domain SEO Analysis](https://serpstat.com/page/domain-analysis-online/): Online SEO report for any domain.
- [Domain Batch Analysis](https://serpstat.com/page/batch-analysis/): Compare up to 100,000 metrics across many domains.
- [Keyword Batch Analysis](https://serpstat.com/page/keyword-batch-analysis/): Bulk analysis of large keyword lists.
- [Keyword Trends](https://serpstat.com/page/keyword-trends/): Trending search queries by region.
- [IndexNow Submission](https://serpstat.com/indexnow/): Submit URLs to search engines via the IndexNow protocol.
- [Search Engine IP Lookup](https://serpstat.com/ip-lookup/): Verify whether a request originates from a real search engine bot.

## Data products & enterprise services

- [Custom datasets (data.serpstat.com)](https://data.serpstat.com/): Enterprise-grade SEO data delivery hub on a separate subdomain.
- [SERP API Scraper](https://data.serpstat.com/serp-api-scraper/): Top-100 Google SERP scraping API; region/city, JSON output, 100K keywords at once.
- [API Keyword Volume Checker](https://data.serpstat.com/api-keyword-volume-checker/): Bulk keyword search-volume API; 50K keywords per request.
- [Custom Reports & White Label](https://serpstat.com/custom-reports/): Branded auto-reports with custom logos and granular access.
- [Team Management](https://serpstat.com/team-management/): Multi-user team accounts.
- [Search Engines Storm](https://serpstat.com/projects/search-engine-storm/): Real-time SERP-volatility tracking project.

